  "details": "The opposite side of a Real Time light doesn't darken the Light Probe Specular so it shines through and makes it glow though the Roughness map\n\nRealtime lights have Specular direction data that can be used to darken the side opposite of the light so this is a fixable issue\n\nMobile Standard Lite didn't have this problem before Light Probe Specular was added",
